# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit 79ff091 on excavador-turing/tpi branch `hive`: the
# rename does not move your metrics history. Renaming a board used to be
# described as carrying its metrics with it; the series carry no board name at
# all, so nothing moves and the CLI stops saying otherwise.
#
# Measured 2026-09-11 with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container, from a
# tree with no buildroot/local.mk: `make tpi-source` reported got b5108b8c
# against a zeroed expectation, then re-run to confirm it fetches and
# verifies cleanly.
